# A combobox's keys (5-A1's start, the listbox slice), played on APG's own
# "Editable Combobox With List Autocomplete" example in Chromium (apg/,
# see apg/NOTICE.md) and on vapors' defaults in combobox.wisp: the
# projection of the combobox, its listbox and options after each key.
# No typing: filtering the options as you type is the app's.
page apg/combobox-autocomplete-list.html
project combobox listbox option
listen keydown focusin
key Tab                       focus: closed, nothing active
expect focus input#cb1-input
key ArrowDown                 opens on the first option
expect focus input#cb1-input
key ArrowDown                 the next
expect focus input#cb1-input
key ArrowUp                   back
expect focus input#cb1-input
key ArrowUp                   past the first: wraps to the last
expect focus input#cb1-input
key End                       the caret's key: no option active, still open
expect focus input#cb1-input
key ArrowDown                 the first again
expect focus input#cb1-input
key Escape                    closes
expect value input#cb1-input ""
key ArrowDown                 opens on the first
expect focus input#cb1-input
key Enter                     chooses it: the field takes its text, closed
expect value input#cb1-input Alabama
key Escape                    closed already: clears the field
expect value input#cb1-input ""
